  "notes": "COMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- おんぶ⟦して→する：00392_suru⟧⟦もらう→もらう：00520_morau⟧: to get a piggyback ride\n- おんぶ⟦{紐|ひも}→紐：02251_himo⟧: a strap for carrying a baby on one's back\n- おんぶ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{抱|だ}っこ: literally \"piggyback and front-carry\"; being completely dependent on someone, leaving everything to them\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {抱|だ}っこ: carrying in one's arms, on the front\n- ⟦{肩車|かたぐるま}→肩車：16181_kataguruma⟧: carrying someone on one's shoulders",
